                    },
                    "message": "lldpctl provides watch mechanisms that creates asynchronous listener on interface changes. It provides a more efficient solution than polling. \nSee LldpWatch https://github.com/lldpd/lldpd/blob/master/src/lib/lldpctl.hpp#L468"
