                        "name": "Abhilash Raju",
                        "email": "abhilash.kollam@gmail.com",
                        "username": "abhilashraju"
                    },
                    "message": "Have we considered using lldpctl -f json? Pulling structured JSON directly would make our parsing code more memory-safe and less prone to errors."
                },
                {
                    "file": "src/lldp/lldp_interface.cpp",
                    "line": 196,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Ravi Teja",
                        "email": "raviteja28031990@gmail.com",
                        "username": "raviteja-b"
                    },
                    "message": "there is no lldpctl API call which can return data in json format"
                },
                {
                    "file": "src/lldp/lldp_interface.cpp",
                    "line": 196,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Abhilash Raju",
                        "email": "abhilash.kollam@gmail.com",
                        "username": "abhilashraju"
                    },
                    "message": "I mean system(lldpctl -f json) or as below if you use boost\n```\n        bp::ipstream output_pipe;\n        bp::child child_process(\"/usr/sbin/lldpctl\", bp::args({\"-f\", \"json\"}),\n                                bp::std_out > output_pipe);\n\n        std::string line;\n        std::string json_output;\n\n        // Read all output from the child process's stdout\n        while (std::getline(output_pipe, line))\n        {\n            json_output += line;\n        }\n        std::cout << json_output << std::endl;\n        ```"
                },
                {
                    "file": "src/lldp/lldp_interface.cpp",
                    "line": 257,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Abhilash Raju",
                        "email": "abhilash.kollam@gmail.com",
                        "username": "abhilashraju"
                    },
                    "message": "should be freed?"
                },
                {
                    "file": "src/lldp/lldp_interface.cpp",
