                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Asmitha Karunanithi",
                        "email": "asmitk01@in.ibm.com",
                        "username": "asmithakarun"
                    },
                    "message": "These shouldnt be freed, because these are borrowed pointers from the parent in liblldpctl, and they point to the memory owned by the parent lldpctl_atom_t (neigh - in this case)\n\nSo, chassis_id, portid, sysname, sysdesc belongs to neigh. \nFinally neigh will be freed below: lldpctl_atom_dec_ref(neigh); and automatically frees these pointers."
                },
